<view class="page"><view class="title">找到你的合拍伙伴</view><view class="subtitle">了解动物信息与价格，收藏喜欢的小伙伴。</view><view class="search"><text class="muted">⌕</text><input placeholder="搜索名字、品种" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="reload" confirm-type="search" maxlength="50"/><button class="text-btn" bindtap="reload">搜索</button></view><view class="tabs"><button class="tab {{category === '' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-category="" bindtap="category">全部</button><button class="tab {{category === 'cat' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-category="cat" bindtap="category">猫咪</button><button class="tab {{category === 'dog' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-category="dog" bindtap="category">狗狗</button><button id="price-filter" class="tab {{cheap ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="filter">{{cheap ? '2千以内' : '筛选'}}</button></view><view class="between list-meta"><text>{{total}} 位{{demo ? '示例' : ''}}小伙伴</text><text>默认排序 ↓</text></view><load-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bind:retry="reload"/><view class="grid"><pet-card class="pet-card" wx:for="{{pets}}" wx:key="id" pet="{{item}}"/></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !pets.length}}" class="panel muted">没有符合条件的宠物，试试其他分类或价格。</view><view class="demo-note">{{demo ? 'DEMO 示例展示 · ' : ''}}浏览资料与价格，记录喜欢的小伙伴。</view></view>
